{
  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "him, o\u00fe hie wyldran w\u00e6ron \u00feonne hie, & hie \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s IIII hunde wintrum & LXXXI, becom on Romane micel Ond eac \u00fea diofla \u00fee hie an simbel weor\u00feedon hi amirdon, toeacan \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum monigfealdum On \u00f0\u00e6re ilcan tide Caperronie w\u00e6s hatenu heora goda nunne. \u00dea gebyrede hiere \u00fe\u00e6t heo hie forl\u00e6g. Hie \u00fea Romane for \u00fe\u00e6m gylte hi ahengon, & eac \u00feone \u00fee \u00feone gylt mid hiere geworhte, & ealle \u00fea Hu wene we, nu Romane him self \u00feyllic writon & setton for heora agnum gielpe & heringe, & \u00feeah Nu we sculon fon, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, ymb \u00fe\u00e6t Punica gewin, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s of \u00fe\u00e6m folce of Cartaina \u00fe\u00e6re Sio w\u00e6s getimbred from Elisan \u00fe\u00e6m wifmen, LXXIIItigum wintra \u00e6r Romeburg. Swa some \u00feara burgwarena yfel & heora bismeres wear\u00f0 lytel as\u00e6d & awriten, swa swa Trogus & Swa \u00feeah toeacan \u00fe\u00e6m yflum, hie gesetton, \u00feonne him micel moncwealm on becom, \u00fe\u00e6t hie & w\u00e6ron \u00fea men to\u00f0on dysige \u00fe\u00e6t hie wendon \u00fe\u00e6t hie mehten \u00fe\u00e6t yfel mid \u00fe\u00e6m gestillan, & \u00fea & for \u00feon \u00fee hie swa swi\u00f0e dysige w\u00e6ron, him com on Godes wracu an gefeohtum toeacan o\u00ferum \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s oftost on Sicilium & on Sardinium \u00fe\u00e6m iglondum, on \u00fea hie gelomlicost wunnon. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee him swa oftr",
